[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1947414022","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2386#issuecomment-1947414022","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2386","id":1947414022,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE850Ey4G","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-15T22:04:52Z","updated_at":"2024-02-15T22:04:52Z","body":"this is very similar to BSD-3-Clause, except:\r\n- it adds \"use of the Software in source and binary forms\" instead of just \"use in source and binary forms\" in the lead in\r\n- the clauses are in a different order with what we normally consider the third clause appearing first\r\n- the warranty of disclaimers has different wording: it adds a disclaimer of noninfringement, and then has less details as to exclusion of types of damages in the last part and also expands that to \"use of other dealings\" with the software\r\n\r\nGiven the above, I suspect we should add this as a new license","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1947414022/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1962546909","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2386#issuecomment-1962546909","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2386","id":1962546909,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE850-hbd","user":{"login":"karsten-klein","id":20038021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDM4MDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20038021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein","html_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-24T18:58:32Z","updated_at":"2024-02-25T10:11:27Z","body":"**ScanCode**\r\nlicense id: [fftpack-2004](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/fftpack-2004.LICENSE)\r\n\r\n**{metæffekt} Universe**\r\ncanonical name: [Spherepack License](https://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/[s]/README.md#user-content-spherepack-license:~:text=Spherepack%20License)\r\nshort name: Spherepack\r\n\r\n**Open CoDE**\r\nOpen CoDE status: approved\r\nOpen CoDE approved license reference: LicenseRef-scancode-fftpack-2004\r\n\r\n**Comments**\r\nSeems we detected that licenses in another context (Spherepack); see also https://sources.debian.org/src/spherepack/3.3~a1-5/debian/copyright/.\r\nTo consolidate naming I would conclude either a \r\n* \"UCAR Software License\", \"UCAR\" in short or \r\n* \"NCAR Software License\" and \"NCAR\" as short id (since the abbreviation is also part of the text and not only of the copyright).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1962546909/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1974108268","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2386#issuecomment-1974108268","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2386","id":1974108268,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE851qoBs","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-03-02T00:04:44Z","updated_at":"2024-03-02T00:04:44Z","body":"interesting, so the license in link for the submission seems to got to piperwire project, and then it calls it the \"FFTPACK license\" in the file. Has the same 2004 copyright notice as what @karsten-klein found in Debian seems to inicate the file is part of spherepack. \r\n\r\nDoing a Google search on a phrase, turns up a few other places, but notably: https://www.ncl.ucar.edu/Download/NCL_source_license.shtml\r\n\r\nSo, I think @karsten-klein  idea as to using UCAR or NCAR in the name makes the most sense to me. Note that UCAR is essentially the umbrella organization under which NCAR sits (and happens to be located in my home town in a prominent location on a mesa below the flatiron rock formations and in a building of sandstone designed by the famous I.M Pei... but I digress...)\r\n\r\nWe do have a UCAR License already on the list - https://spdx.org/licenses/UCAR.html\r\n\r\nPerhaps we could go with \"NCL Source Code License\" and \"NCL\" since that is the title on this page https://www.ncl.ucar.edu/Download/NCL_source_license.shtml\r\nI would note that the license text there is slightly different than in FFTPACk in that \"of the Software\" is omitted at the above  link, whereas it is in the license text in the FFTPACK link:\r\n\"Redistribution and use of the Software in source and binary forms\"\r\n\r\nAn alternative might be NCAR-CISL ?\r\n\r\nI'd hesitate to use only NCAR as it seems likely we may see other licenses from UCAR/NCAR","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1974108268/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1980624145","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2386#issuecomment-1980624145","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2386","id":1980624145,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE852De0R","user":{"login":"nielsdg","id":1382976,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODI5NzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1382976?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsdg","html_url":"https://github.com/nielsdg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsdg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsdg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsdg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsdg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsdg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsdg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsdg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsdg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nielsdg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-03-06T11:08:17Z","updated_at":"2024-03-06T11:08:17Z","body":"@wtay : I don't know how well you remember the licensing of the file you copied in Pipewire here, but do you have some thoughts on it?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1980624145/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2025228687","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2386#issuecomment-2025228687","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2386","id":2025228687,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE854tomP","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":67856